<season>
  <plot>**[Pace Team presents: One Pace Specials!]**

Featuring:
1. **One Piece Fan Letter** -- The legendary Megumi Ishitani's fan-favorite passion project! [Loosely adapts 'One Piece novel: Straw Hat Stories']
2. **[Cover Story 236-262] Wapol's Omnivorous Hurrah** -- Discover what ol' "Tin-Plate" Wapol was up to between when he got stomped by Luffy and co. in Drum Island and his grand return in the Reverie arc! [Adapts cover story 'Wapol's Omnivorous Hurrah' from chapters 236-262 of the manga]
3. **[0] Strong World** -- 'Episode 0: Strong World' serves as the official prequel to the fan-favorite 'One Piece Film: Strong World'! Discover the backstory of the film's big bad, 'Golden Lion' Shiki, once commander of the largest pirate fleet in the world, and one of Pirate King Gol D. Roger's biggest rivals! [Adapts Chapter [0] 'Strong World', a special one-shot canon chapter of the 'One Piece' manga]
4. **Straw Hat Theatre** -- The Straw Hats as cranky old ladies. The Straw Hats as the mafia. The Straw Hats as fairy tale creatures. It's the Straw Hat Theatre.
5. **Romance Dawn, Version 2** -- Did you know that there exists an alternate version of Romance Dawn that predates *One Piece* itself, written by Oda himself? Check it out!
6. **[823-824] A World Abuzz (Whole Cake Island 01 -- April Fools 2017)** -- The first episode of the Whole Cake Island arc, featuring a custom Pace-original dub! Bare witness to the single greatest English One Piece dub ever made... (opinion subjective)
7. **[42, 22] You're the Weird Animal (Gaimon 01 -- April Fools 2021)** -- It's Gaimon! In Klingon! One Piece is quite popular on Qo'noS, you know.
8. **Tournament of Power (Dragon Ball Super -- April Fools 2023)** -- It's the tournament of power from Dragon Ball Super! Yes, Pace Team has decided to branch into other franchises now. Or, at least that's what they SAID they were doing in their release announcement. They released this on March 31st, so surely they were being legit and it wasn't just an April Fools bit, right?
9. **[199-201] The Desert Doo Doo Hits the Fan (4kids -- Alabasta 16 -- April Fools 2024)** -- It's episode 16 of the Alabasta arc! ...er, the infamous 4Kids dub version, anyway.
10. **[Filler] Precursor to a New Adventure! Apis, a Mysterious Girl! (Warship Island 01 -- April Fools 2025)** -- Here, Zoro. Yeah. Here you go, Zoro. Yeah.</plot>
